# International > Number Format with the decimal separator deleted: OK shows MAIN.CPL string 800 in
# a message box (MB_ICONINFORMATION), whose OK puts the focus back in the edit; then Cancel, Cancel
# and WIN.INI keeps its separators. Same keys as arch311-ref/scn/intl-numerr.scn after opening. Run
# as intl.w16 (ARCH311_REF_INI=1, ARCH311_CLOCK="2026-10-08 09:30:24", applet International).
# The message box frame checks USER's MessageBox layout (two-line text, icon, one button).
# regress: ARCH311_REF_INI=1 ARCH311_CLOCK="2026-10-08 09:30:24" sh tools/run-cp-test.sh "$TEST" "$OUT" International
# compare: intl-numerr/02.png 01-open.png active ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: intl-numerr/03.png 02-number.png active ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: intl-numerr/04.png 03-msgbox.png active ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: intl-numerr/05.png 04-back.png active ignore 320 240 332 260
# ini: WIN.INI intl sDecimal=.
# ini: WIN.INI intl sThousand=,
sleep 900
shot shots/01-open.png
key tab
key tab
key tab
key tab
key tab
key tab
key tab
key tab
key enter
sleep 600
shotcaret shots/02-number.png
key tab
key del
key enter
sleep 600
shot shots/03-msgbox.png
key enter
sleep 400
shotcaret shots/04-back.png
key esc
key esc
sleep 400
quit
